WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.580
 (upbeat music)

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:07.960
 Mattress companies make a lot of claims.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.240
 It's hard to know what's legit, what's real,

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.520
 what's made up, and what really matters.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.280
 At EarthFoam, we keep our certifications simple

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.240
 by going straight for the toughest standards

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.680
 in the things that matter the most.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.860
 Fair trade, organic materials, and health.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:27.880
 Every certification is under our name, up to date,

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:31.360
 and verified by a totally unbiased third party.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.600
 You can read about them in detail on our website,

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.800
 and rest assured, the only fluffiness you'll find

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.540
 is in our mattresses.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:41.120
 (upbeat music)

